# Frequency conversion between hertz and kilohertz

Verifies direct conversion between hertz and kilohertz in both directions. Hertz converts to the coarser unit through decimal promotion, while kilohertz converts to hertz with an integer scale.

>>> source
forward_whole: int = 1hz
print(forward_whole->to(khz))
forward_fractional: decimal = 1.5hz
print(forward_fractional->to(khz))
backward_whole: int = 1khz
print(backward_whole->to(hz))
backward_fractional: decimal = 1.5khz
print(backward_fractional->to(hz))

<<< stdout
0.001khz
0.0015khz
1000hz
1500.0hz

<<< stderr
